👉 SEO suffers because HTML is empty until JS loads.

Example: SSR (Express + React)
import express from "express";
import ReactDOMServer from "react-dom/server";
import App from "./App";

const app = express();

app.get("*", (req, res) => {
  const html = ReactDOMServer.renderToString(<App />);
  res.send(`<!DOCTYPE html><div id="root">${html}</div>`);
});

app.listen(3000);


👉 Better SEO & faster TTFB.

